Subject: [PATCH] Fix and expand sample-trip seed script to 10 trips
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

scripts/seed-trips.ts (wired to the admin /api/admin/seed-data route)
had hardcoded Jan 2025 dates, which now fail the check_trip_date_future
DB constraint since they're in the past; capitalized region values
("Central") that don't match trip-card.tsx's lowercase region-color
lookup, so badges silently fell back to gray; and pre-rebrand
theceylonx.com branding. Fixed all three, switched dates to rolling
futureDate() offsets so the script stays runnable indefinitely, and
added 2 more trips (Arugam Bay, Jaffna) to reach 10 — ids already used
the sample-trip- prefix that trip-card.tsx checks to show the
"🎯 Sample Trip" badge, so no frontend change was needed.

Deleted scripts/seed-sample-trips.ts: a second, unrelated seed script
only reachable via `npm run seed:trips`, using trip-seed- prefixed ids
(no Sample Trip badge) and missing the organizer contact fields the
trips table requires, so it would have failed on insert. Repointed
seed:trips/seed:all in package.json at the fixed script instead.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
